        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Sarah Jane Adventures, Doctor Who, Queer as Folk, Bob & Rose, The Second Coming, Casanova, Cucumber, Tofu, Banana\n- People: Russell T Davies, Elisabeth Sladen\n- Organizations: BBC Cymru Wales, CBBC\n- Roles: screenwriter, television producer, creator, starring actor\n- Topics: British science fiction television, Welsh television\n\nFacts:\n- Russell T Davies was born as Stephen Russell Davies on 27 April 1963 and is better known as Russell T Davies.\n- Russell T Davies is a Welsh screenwriter and television producer.\n- Russell T Davies created the 2005 revival of the classic British science fiction series Doctor Who.\n- Russell T Davies's works include Queer as Folk, Bob & Rose, The Second Coming, Casanova, and the trilogy Cucumber, Tofu, and Banana.\n- The Sarah Jane Adventures is a British science fiction television programme.\n- The Sarah Jane Adventures was produced by BBC Cymru Wales for CBBC.\n- The Sarah Jane Adventures was created by Russell T Davies and starred Elisabeth Sladen.",
